# 1.5.26: the sequencer second page (Sequence, HOME again): Swing
wait 300
turn SELECT 1 100
expect view 105
tap HOME
expect view 106
wait 100
expect par26 0
turn K1 4 100
expect par26 4
turn K1 -2 100
expect par26 2
tap HOME
expect view 107
listen
where
said Dialogue
where
said Tension
spin K1 -100
wait 600
turn K1 80 150
expect par537 80
tap SAVE
wait 300
reboot
wait 300
expect par537 80
turn SELECT 1 100
expect view 105
turn SELECT 1 100
expect view 1
